Enforces two static dimensions in the ~30s targeted lane, closing the defect
classes that took 10 review rounds on the batch-1 skills PR:
- DOCUMENTATION (auditCommandDocumentation): every non-exempt coverage.json
  command must be documented in its owning skill body (name-equality or a
  word-boundary token), else it's a hollow mapping. Fixed the one real gap:
  status now documents 'forge prime'.
- ROUTER PRECISION (auditRouterPrecision): every should_trigger:false fixture
  must NOT route to its own skill — the negative complement to routerReachability.
  Added adversarial fixtures for the exact collisions we hit (SonarCloud gate
  status -> not gates; PR-from-worktree -> not worktree).

Both are pure/injectable + unit-tested with synthetic skills. Registered in
SKILL_TEST_TARGETS so skill edits run it. Deferred dimensions (need a
prerequisite): flag reachability (07c3daf6 parseFlags unification — a naive
check is ~45 false positives across passthrough/self-parse paths), full
command-name routability (7920f747), functional smoke (execution harness).

Closes 7ee6de45. .agents mirror synced by hook.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
